message: "If you use or evaluate this scoring protocol, please cite it as below."
title: "EBRS - European Business Reputation Standard (open scoring protocol, public review)"
version: 6.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-17
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Rekvizitai-UAB/ebrs-score"
abstract: >-
  Open-source company reputation scoring protocol: 15 signals, 5 axes,
  null-exclusion principle, coverage shrinkage, terminal-state caps.
  Candidate standard - not adopted by any European standardisation
  organisation; not independently audited.
